## Why This Is Asked

To assess how patterns scale in runtime plugin systems and per-domain routing.

## Key Concepts

- Strategy pattern
- Runtime plug-ins
- Registry with per-domain routing
- Hot-swapping and cache invalidation
- Thread-safety

## Code Example

```javascript
interface StorageProvider {
  save(ctx: any, key: string, value: any): Promise<void>;
  load(ctx: any, key: string): Promise<any>;
}
class StorageRegistry {
  private providers = new Map<string, StorageProvider>();
  register(name: string, p: StorageProvider): void { this.providers.set(name, p); }
  get(name: string): StorageProvider | undefined { return this.providers.get(name); }
}
class DomainRouter {
  private registry: StorageRegistry;
  private domainMap = new Map<string, string>();
  resolve(domain: string): StorageProvider | undefined {
    const name = this.domainMap.get(domain);
    return name ? this.registry.get(name) : undefined;
  }
}
```

